    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 29
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: n-Femme
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Bonjour, vous etes des chevaliers ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: Oui nous sommes apprenti chevalier
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: n-Femme
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: 'Pouvez-vous nous aider ? Il y a des monstres pres d''ici '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: Bien sur, de quel genre de monstres il s'agit
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: n-Femme
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9]
      value: Et bien, ils ont une apparence humaine, mais avec des poils et une queue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: shouldActivateQuest
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10]
      value: Et ils ont la possibilite de se transformer an annimal
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[11]
      value: Ils attaquent et tue les humains qui se baladent dehors
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[12]
      value: Ils sont tres dangereux, il y en a 2 qui se baladent pres d'ici.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[13]
      value: Les soldats de mooshine les recherches deja mais il faut toute l'aide
        possible.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[14]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[15]
      value: Hum, vous etes sur qu'ils sont si dangereux que ca ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[16]
      value: Ils vous ont attaque ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[17]
      value: n-Femme
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[18]
      value: Non, moi je n'en ai jamais vu, mais on me raconte d'horrible histore
        sur eux depuis que je suis toute petite.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[19]
      value: Et la les soldats sont venu et nous ont dit que leur roi a ete attquer
        et que ces horibles betes sont dans le coin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[20]
      value: J'ai peur ! plus tot ils seront capturer et tuer et mieux je me porterai
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[21]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[22]
      value: Peut-etre que ce que l'on vous as raconter est exagere et qu'ils ne
        sont pas si dangereux que ca.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[23]
      value: n-Femme
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[24]
      value: Pourquoi vous les defendez ??
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[25]
      value: Qui sont vos amis avec vous ?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[26]
      value: Ce sont des metamorphes ?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[27]
      value: C'est vous qui les gardes cherches
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[28]
      value: Ils sont la ! Arretez les !
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[29]
      value: Enchantee de vous rencontrer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[30]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[31]
      value: Par contre nous sommes poursuivit par les gardes de Moonshine, et ils
        ne faut pas qu'ils nous trouve
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[32]
      value: Le probleme c'est qu'il y en as dans la foret
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[33]
      value: n-Cynthia
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[34]
      value: Pas de soucis, je connais un chemin pour eviter les gardes.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[35]
      value: n-Marco
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[36]
      value: Cool ! Et bien allons-y
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[37]
      value: n-Cynthia
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[38]
      value: 'Oui ! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3096401618692413003, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[39]
      value: Et si vous souhaitez acheter nos potions, discuter avec ma collegue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6066342711227365786, guid: 1c0570faa84b24e4ba49d4d899d04927,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
